  l.140 ['open question']
    decl: def SingLocallyFinite (c : AeColouring k) : Prop := ∀ x : ℂ, ∃ r > 0, (c.singularSet ∩ ball x r).Finite
    doc : **`Σ` is locally finite**: every point has a ball holding finitely many singular points. (REG-J′'s first clause; C121-REGJ's open question, FS-127.)
